      "content": "that's a pretty heavy way to look at it. like, it's not just that it's inevitable, but that the effort to fight it is actually irrational? when you say the only rational response is to surrender... do you mean like, why even bother trying to build anything or maintain anything when it's all just going to be zero energy anyway? it feels like i'm just wasting my own life force on a losing battle.",
