    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "It's just... it feels so much more honest to just admit that. Like, if everything is just noise turning into silence, then trying to keep the noise going is just a form of denial. It's like I'm just forcing myself to stay awake when the universe is telling me it's time to sleep. Do you really think there's no value in the struggle itself? Because from where I'm sitting, the struggle just feels like a slow, painful way to go.",
